--- Overview
Removes the AppDir field from cmdconfig.Spec, leaving Path as the only way to set the search path. When Path is empty, the search path now defaults to the current directory.

--- Key Changes
cmdutil/cmdconfig
  * Spec: removed AppDir. Path is now the only search-path setting.
  * FilesFlag.Locate: an empty Spec.Path now defaults to "." instead of SearchPath(spec.AppDir).
  * Updated the Spec docs in configfile.go and README.md to match.
  * Tests: switched from Spec{AppDir: x} to Spec{Path: cmdconfig.SearchPath(x)}. Added TestFilesFlagLocateDefaultPath to check the current-directory default.

--- Breaking Changes
  * cmdconfig.Spec.AppDir is removed. Callers should use Spec{Path: cmdconfig.SearchPath(appDir)} instead.
  * A Spec with no Path now searches only the current directory. It no longer searches the per-app directories that SearchPath provided.
